{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:949951fa3e0c2153","name":"Attack Leader","source":{"id":"source:reference-949951fa3e0c2153","title":"Attack Leader","revision":16002,"timestamp":"2024-08-18T00:53:31Z","sha256":"351c1de2f5c9c04f46a642d89b71182d2632ad1ff40affe11590719f0f9bbe74","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=16002","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Attack%20Leader&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-949951fa3e0c2153","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Clone Wars Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Clone_Wars_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The Attack Leader coordinates all the Battalion's attacks. An Attack Leader can order attacks and use special tactics. A ",{"tag":"a","children":["Battalion"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Battalion"}," can have only one Attack Leader at a time.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The below Actions include all Actions that can be performed while functioning as an Attack Leader:\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Standard Actions"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Standard_Actions"}]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Aid Another"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["As a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Standard Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Standard_Action"},", you can aid an ally's next skill check or attack roll, or you can interfere with an enemy's attacks.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Aiding a Skill Check"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["You can help another character achieve success on their ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skill Check"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skill_Check"}," or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Ability Check"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ability_Check"}," by making the same kind of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skill Check"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skill_Check"}," or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Ability Check"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ability_Check"}," in a cooperative effort. If you roll a 10 or higher on your check, the character you are helping receives a +2 bonus on their own check. You can't ",{"tag":"a","children":["Take 10"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Take_10"}," on a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skill Check"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skill_Check"}," or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Ability Check"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ability_Check"}," to Aid Another.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Aiding an Attack Roll"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["In combat, you can Aid Another character's attack by forcing an opponent to avoid your own attacks, making it more difficult for them to avoid your ally. Select an opponent and make an attack against a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"}," of 10. If you succeed, you grant a +2 bonus on a single ally's next attack roll against that opponent.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["In ",{"tag":"a","children":["Mass Combat"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Mass_Combat"},", you can aid the attack roll of another ",{"tag":"a","children":["Battalion"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Battalion"}," or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle"}," by adding your Battalion's firepower to the attack.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"ul","children":[{"tag":"li","children":["An Attack Leader selects a target within the range of their Battalion's weapons, and the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Battalion"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Battalion"}," makes an attack roll against a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"}," of 10 (applying all ",{"tag":"a","children":["Range"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Range"}," penalties as though the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Battalion"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Battalion"}," is attacking the designated target). If this attack is successful, the Attack Leader grants a single adjacent allied ",{"tag":"a","children":["Battalion"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Battalion"}," or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle"}," a +2 bonus on its next attack roll made against that target before the beginning of the Attack Leader's next turn."]}]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Melee and Ranged Attacks"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["All ",{"tag":"a","children":["Battalions"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Battalions"}," can make ",{"tag":"a","children":["Melee Attacks"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Melee_Attacks","referenceId":"reference:dbacc8ccae71d4dc"}," and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Ranged Attacks"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ranged_Attacks","referenceId":"reference:3c89b302f9fd687b"}," if they possess the appropriate weaponry. Apply the bonuses to the attack roll and compare the result to the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"}," of the target, as normal. A Battalion's attack bonuses are listed in its statistics blocks.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["A ",{"tag":"a","children":["Battalion"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Battalion"}," can make ",{"tag":"a","children":["Melee Attacks"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Melee_Attacks","referenceId":"reference:dbacc8ccae71d4dc"}," against another ",{"tag":"a","children":["Battalion"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Battalion"}," occupying the same space (see ",{"tag":"a","children":["Fighting Space"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Fighting_Space","referenceId":"reference:cdbf34043baceb78"},"). Only ground ",{"tag":"a","children":["Battalions"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Battalions"}," can make ",{"tag":"a","children":["Melee Attacks"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Melee_Attacks","referenceId":"reference:dbacc8ccae71d4dc"},", and only against other ground ",{"tag":"a","children":["Battalions"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Battalions"},".\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["A ",{"tag":"a","children":["Battalion"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Battalion"}," can make ",{"tag":"a","children":["Ranged Attacks"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ranged_Attacks","referenceId":"reference:3c89b302f9fd687b"}," against ",{"tag":"a","children":["Battalions"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Battalions"}," within its weapons' ",{"tag":"a","children":["Ranges"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ranges"},".\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"table","children":["\n",{"tag":"tbody","children":[{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"th","children":["WEAPON TYPE\n"],"rowspan":2},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["STARSHIP SCALE RANGE\n"],"colspan":4}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"th","children":["POINT-BLANK\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["SHORT\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["MEDIUM\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["LONG\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Heavy Weapons"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Heavy_Weapons","referenceId":"reference:a2b1d4c4bac82300"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["0\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["1\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["2-3\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["4\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Pistol"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Pistol"},{"tag":"sup","children":["1"]},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["0\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["-\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["-\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["1\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Rifles"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Rifles","referenceId":"reference:a6ebe3ecc8b0b281"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["0\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["1\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["2\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["3\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Simple Weapons"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Simple_Weapons"},{"tag":"sup","children":["1"]},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["0\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["-\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["-\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["1\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":["Thrown Weapons",{"tag":"sup","children":["2"]},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["0\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["-\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["-\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["-\n"]}]}]}]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"sup","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["1: This weapon can be used only at Point-Blank or Long Range."]}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"sup","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["2: This weapon can be used only at Point-Blank Range."]}]},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Vehicle Attacks"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Individual ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicles"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicles"}," in ",{"tag":"a","children":["Mass Combat"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Mass_Combat"}," can make attacks against ",{"tag":"a","children":["Battalions"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Battalions"}," as normal. Vehicle Battalions follow all the same restrictions as Nonvehicle Battalions on their attacks. ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicles"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicles"}," and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle Battalions"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle_Battalions?action=edit&redlink=1"}," use the standard ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starship Scale"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starship_Scale"}," for determining the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Range"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Range"}," on their ",{"tag":"a","children":["Weapon Systems"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Weapon_Systems"},". ",{"tag":"a","children":["Character Scale"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Character_Scale"}," weapons, such as those wielded by Nonvehicle Battalions, use the table for ",{"tag":"a","children":["Ranged Attacks"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ranged_Attacks","referenceId":"reference:3c89b302f9fd687b"}," to determine their ",{"tag":"a","children":["Range"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Range"}," at ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starship Scale"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starship_Scale"},".\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["All normal weapon ",{"tag":"a","children":["Range"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Range"}," penalties still apply.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Fight Defensively"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["An Attack Leader can order their ",{"tag":"a","children":["Battalion"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Battalion"}," to Fight Defensively as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Standard Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Standard_Action"},", hunkering down to resist an incoming attack. The ",{"tag":"a","children":["Battalion"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Battalion"}," can make no ",{"tag":"a","children":["Attacks"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Attacks","referenceId":"reference:1e3a955bd202b306"}," until the beginning of the Attack Leader's next turn, but gains a +5 bonus to its ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"},".\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
